# Dedektif — EAS Build Archive Exclusions
# Paths are relative to the project root (artifacts/dedektif/)
# and matched against the full path from the repository root.

# ── Test / QA artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
e2e/
screenshots/
test-results/
playwright.config.ts

# ── Dev-only tooling inside the app package ──────────────────────────────────
scripts/
server/
app_new.json

# ── Root-level workspace dirs not needed on EAS servers ──────────────────────
.agents/
.local/

# ── Other workspace packages (not part of the mobile build) ──────────────────
artifacts/api-server/
artifacts/api-spec/
artifacts/db/
artifacts/mockup-sandbox/

# ── Common noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
*.log
*.map
.DS_Store
